        array("id" => "s2008e15", "season" => 2008, "number" => 15, "name" => "Writhe", "airdate" => "24 Apr 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Learning that his chakra is of the \"wind\" type that is outstanding for fighting, Naruto puts more effort into his training.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1222899.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e16", "season" => 2008, "number" => 16, "name" => "Robbed of Sleep", "airdate" => "8 May 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Team Kakashi is ordered to resolve the frequent vandalizing of graves at the Fire Temple. When it becomes clear that the vandals aren't after the possessions buried with the dead, Yamato suspects that they want the corpses of the ninja buried in the four hidd…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1222908.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e17", "season" => 2008, "number" => 17, "name" => "Loneliness", "airdate" => "8 May 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "At the Fire Temple, Chiriku explains to Team Kakashi that the hidden tombs hold the guards of the Land of Fire's feudal lord. At one time Chiriku and Asuma were members of that organization.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1222984.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e18", "season" => 2008, "number" => 18, "name" => "A New Enemy", "airdate" => "15 May 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Word comes that the last of the hidden graves has been broken into. Naruto and the others go after the coffin, but it turns out to be a trap.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e19", "season" => 2008, "number" => 19, "name" => "Impermanence", "airdate" => "22 May 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Team Kakashi is split up by the enemy's Earth Summoning Jutsu. They are forced to fight the attacking assassins, but the enemy has the advantage since they know the lay of the land.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223067.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e20", "season" => 2008, "number" => 20, "name" => "Contact", "airdate" => "29 May 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Sora confronts Furido, the mysterious figure who has broken into the hidden graves. Impressed by Sora's unusual strength, he admonishes him, \"You should reevaluate how you use that power Heaven has blessed you with,\" and disappears, leaving him with a cryptic…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223355.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e21", "season" => 2008, "number" => 21, "name" => "Teammate", "airdate" => "5 Jun 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Yamato believes that the assailants were not grave robbers but were after Sora. He decides to appoint Sora to Team Kakashi as a temporary stand-in for the injured Sai.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223364.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e22", "season" => 2008, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Two Kings", "airdate" => "19 Jun 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "By chance, Naruto and Sora get Asuma to coach them. Under the guidance of Asuma's iron fist, they immerse themselves in training with Wind Chakra.less", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223421.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e23", "season" => 2008, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Jet-Black Signal Fire", "airdate" => "3 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Tsunade catches Danzo in a secret meeting with a ninja from the Hidden Rain Village. But the ninja turns out to be a spy for the Hidden Leaf.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223878.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e24", "season" => 2008, "number" => 24, "name" => "Lockdown of Darkness", "airdate" => "3 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Under cover of a giant power outage, Furido begins his assault on the Hidden Leaf. The village immediately goes on alert, but Furido's men put up a barrier, and everyone in the village is trapped inside.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223885.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e25", "season" => 2008, "number" => 25, "name" => "Revived Souls", "airdate" => "10 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "In order to stop the impending disaster, Asuma rushes toward the electric generator system. There he sees the Guardian Shinobi Twelve who have come to life once more through Revival Jutsu after their graves were robbed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1223970.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e26", "season" => 2008, "number" => 26, "name" => "Everyone's Struggle to the Death", "airdate" => "24 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Sora is speechless when he discovers that Furido not only intends to assassinate the Hokage but plans to totally annihilate Hidden Leaf Village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224000.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e27", "season" => 2008, "number" => 27, "name" => "Moment of Awakening", "airdate" => "31 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Throughout the village, Kitane's fellow Guardian Shinobi with the Lightning Jutsu set up Limelight.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224014.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e28", "season" => 2008, "number" => 28, "name" => "Despair", "airdate" => "31 Jul 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Naruto and Asuma catch up to Sora, only to find him shrouded in ominous chakra and undergoing a change.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224341.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e29", "season" => 2008, "number" => 29, "name" => "Resonance", "airdate" => "7 Aug 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Furido's true form belongs to Kazuma, one of the Guardian Shinobi Twelve who had planned the coup d'état. Asuma puts his honor on the line and goes back ten years to battle Furido once more.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224359.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e30", "season" => 2008, "number" => 30, "name" => "My Friend", "airdate" => "14 Aug 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Naruto desperately tries to suppress Nine Tails' chakra and get through to Sora's heart and soul. Naruto's comrades are helpless against Sora's powerful chakra and can only stand by and watch.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224366.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e31", "season" => 2008, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Quietly Approaching Threat", "airdate" => "21 Aug 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Work continues in Hidden Leaf Village to erase the scars of battle. As he watches Konohamaru and the others helping with the reconstruction, Iruka sees how his students have matured", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224724.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e32", "season" => 2008, "number" => 32, "name" => "Akatsuki's Invasion", "airdate" => "28 Aug 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "With Kakashi's return, Naruto resumes training for his new jutsu. Kakashi explains that the transformation training will enter the next stage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224765.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e33", "season" => 2008, "number" => 33, "name" => "Under the Starry Sky", "airdate" => "4 Sep 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The lone surviving priest is carried into Hidden Leaf Village where he reports the destruction of the Fire Temple.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224766.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e34", "season" => 2008, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Old Monk's Prayer", "airdate" => "11 Sep 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "In order to capture the Akatsuki, the Hidden Leaf cast a net that even an ant could not crawl through. Still, the Akatsuki elude them and frustrate Tsunade to no end.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224767.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e35", "season" => 2008, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Next Step", "airdate" => "25 Sep 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto is learning the elements of Wind Style Jutsu, and Kakashi lectures him on the difficulties of developing a new jutsu.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224830.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e36", "season" => 2008, "number" => 36, "name" => "Climbing Silver", "airdate" => "25 Sep 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Asuma and his team finally confront Hidan, and a battle ensues. They fight with all their strength but are shocked at Hidan's power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224983.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e37", "season" => 2008, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Judgment", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Hidan releases a baffling jutsu, and Asuma bears the brunt of the attack. The jutsu is a special trick which links Hidan with Asuma's body.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/489/1224994.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e38", "season" => 2008, "number" => 38, "name" => "Unfulfilled Scream", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Shikamaru unravels the secret of Hidan's jutsu just in time, and Asuma attacks with all his being.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225001.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e39", "season" => 2008, "number" => 39, "name" => "Last Words", "airdate" => "16 Oct 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Asuma is mortally wounded by Hidan's jutsu, and the Akatsuki have the rest of the Hidden Leaf in a bind.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225281.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e40", "season" => 2008, "number" => 40, "name" => "Sad News", "airdate" => "23 Oct 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "In a faraway land, the Akatsuki reveal their true aim of world conquest. And back at Hidden Leaf Village, Shikamaru gives his report of the mission to Tsunade.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225425.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e41", "season" => 2008, "number" => 41, "name" => "Team 10", "airdate" => "30 Oct 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Asuma's funeral is held in Hidden Leaf Village amid deep sadness. Shikamaru is the lone absentee, unable to get over the loss.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225432.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e42", "season" => 2008, "number" => 42, "name" => "Target: Locked On", "airdate" => "6 Nov 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Kakashi and Team 10 set out to stop the Akatsuki. Tsunade considers Naruto's Team 7 to be the ideal back-up for Team 10 and orders Naruto to perfect his new jutsu within 24 hours.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225471.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e43", "season" => 2008, "number" => 43, "name" => "Kakuzu's Abilities", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Shikamaru and Choji deliver the first blows in the battle, but they are thwarted by Kakuzu's power. Kakashi counters Kakuzu's trick and brings him down.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225493.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e44", "season" => 2008, "number" => 44, "name" => "Terrifying Secret", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Shikamaru and his comrades desperately counter the Fire Jutsu offensive. But continuously using his Rasengan and Lightning Blade takes its toll on Kakashi.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225591.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e45", "season" => 2008, "number" => 45, "name" => "Shikamaru's Genius", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Shikamaru battles Hidan alone, deep in the forest, and after depleting his chakra, sustains a deep wound. Hidan draws his blood as he lies near death.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225592.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e46", "season" => 2008, "number" => 46, "name" => "When You Curse Someone, You Dig Your Own Grave", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto and Team Kakashi arrive just in time to assist Team Asuma. Sakura and Sai are ordered by Kakashi to aid Shikamaru, who is battling alone.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225598.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e47", "season" => 2008, "number" => 47, "name" => "Wind Release: Rasenshuriken!", "airdate" => "11 Dec 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Ino and Choji are amazed at Naruto's new jutsu, and Kakuzu senses the danger that it poses. But when released, the new jutsu dissipates before it reaches Kakuzu", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1225667.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e48", "season" => 2008, "number" => 48, "name" => "The Price of Power", "airdate" => "18 Dec 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Naruto's uses his new jutsu to bring Kakuzu down. Tsunade welcomes the teams back home and orders Team Asuma and Team Yamato to take a break.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1226133.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2008e49", "season" => 2008, "number" => 49, "name" => "A Shinobi's Determination", "airdate" => "25 Dec 2008", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Just when peace has finally settled over the village word comes that Orochimaru's hideout has been found. Tsunade orders Kakashi, Hinato, Shino, and Kiba on a search mission to find the hideout.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1226582.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2009, "name" => "#311 - #361", "rating" => 8.9, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2009e1", "season" => 2009, "number" => 1, "name" => "Orochimaru's Hideout Discovered", "airdate" => "8 Jan 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Naruto and Jiraiya arrive at the hot springs resort. As an alternative to the Wind Style: Rasen Shuriken, Jiraiya suggests to Naruto the collaboration ninjutsu with a ninja toad.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1226694.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e2", "season" => 2009, "number" => 2, "name" => "Encounter", "airdate" => "15 Jan 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Inside Orochimaru's hideout Guren witnesses Sasuke defeating a thousand opponents. Meanwhile, Kabuto and Yukimaru conduct their experiment to summon the Three-Tailed Beast.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1227057.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e3", "season" => 2009, "number" => 3, "name" => "Connecting Hearts", "airdate" => "22 Jan 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Believing Naruto's new jutsu is almost completed, Jiraiya heads off to investigate new information on the Akatsuki's movements. His arm now healed, Naruto returns to the village to continue his training.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1227058.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e4", "season" => 2009, "number" => 4, "name" => "A Night of Rain", "airdate" => "29 Jan 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Staying behind at the hideout, Rinji and Gozu become aware of a shinobi following their tracks. At the same time, Kakashi and his team notice that the enemy is using a bat for surveillance.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/490/1227156.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e5", "season" => 2009, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Two Charms", "airdate" => "5 Feb 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "At the Leaf Village Naruto is busy training with Gamakichi and Gamatatsu. But when he learns that Kakashi and the others are out on a mission to locate Orochimaru's hideout, Naruto rushes to ask Tsunade if he can join the mission.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1227629.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e6", "season" => 2009, "number" => 6, "name" => "The Unseeing Enemy", "airdate" => "12 Feb 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Team Yamato heads out to provide backup for Team Kakashi. Right before his departure Naruto gets a hint to perfect his new jutsu by entering Gamatatsu's belly.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1227960.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e7", "season" => 2009, "number" => 7, "name" => "The Labyrinth of Distorted Reflection", "airdate" => "19 Feb 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "From the results of the analysis of the crystallized Parasitic insects, the enemies currently fighting Kakashi's team are identified as users of the Crystal Style, a rare type of jutsu. Still unclear on what Orochimaru's objective is, Tsunade cannot hide her…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1227973.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e8", "season" => 2009, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Target Appears", "airdate" => "26 Feb 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Shattering the force field with his newly mastered collaboration jutsu with the toads, Naruto and the reinforcement unit arrive at the battle site. But Naruto's new jutsu is repulsed by Guren's ability to crystallize fluids.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228097.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e9", "season" => 2009, "number" => 9, "name" => "Raging Tailed Beast", "airdate" => "5 Mar 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja use The Bat to pursue Guren. Akamaru and Kiba detect a high level of chakra present at their destination. Convinced something abnormal is about to happen, Kakashi sends Naruto to the lake right before entering battle with the enemy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228385.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e10", "season" => 2009, "number" => 10, "name" => "Inside the Mist", "airdate" => "12 Mar 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Inside the heavy mist, the Leaf ninja manage to rendezvous with Naruto. The team tightens their guard when they learn that the mist surrounding the lake causes illusions. The team discovers that the enemy is after the Three-Tailed Beast, and faced with this u…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228836.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e11", "season" => 2009, "number" => 11, "name" => "Everyone's Feelings", "airdate" => "26 Mar 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto enters the mist to seek out Yukimaru. Guren stays alert to protect Yukimaru, whose current situation prevents him from moving. When both sides meet, their emotion over Yukimaru sparks.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228847.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e12", "season" => 2009, "number" => 12, "name" => "Regroup!", "airdate" => "26 Mar 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Reinforcements arrive from Leaf Village. The new mission from Tsunade: seal the Three-Tailed Beast so it won't fall into anyone else's hands and take Yukimaru whose powers are tied to the Tailed Beast into custody.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228864.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e13", "season" => 2009, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier", "airdate" => "9 Apr 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja wish to seal the Three-Tailed Beast, and Guren's team wishes to stop them at any cost. Shizune's sealing team begins their search as they activate the The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier to trap the Three-Tailed Beast…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1228923.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e14", "season" => 2009, "number" => 14, "name" => "Breaking the Crystal Release", "airdate" => "9 Apr 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "To protect the The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier necessary to seal the Three-Tailed Beast, Kakashi and Naruto wage their deadly battle against Guren. Sai fights a one-on-one battle with Gozu…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229037.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e15", "season" => 2009, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Battle Over the Barrier", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Kabuto plans on breaking the Leaf's The Four-Corner Sealing Barrier from the inside by using Yukimaru's power and have the Three-Tailed Beast go on a rampage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229364.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e16", "season" => 2009, "number" => 16, "name" => "Red Camellia", "airdate" => "23 Apr 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "To protect Guren from the raging Three Tails, Yuukimaru exerts powers beyond his limits. Moved by his action, Guren now comes to regret her past sin of killing Yuukimaru's mother.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229371.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e17", "season" => 2009, "number" => 17, "name" => "Strange Bedfellows", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "To protect Yuukimaru, Naruto and Guren fight alongside each other against the Three-Tailed beast and are swallowed. Inside the beast is an unnatural world filled with limestone.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229536.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e18", "season" => 2009, "number" => 18, "name" => "Guidepost of the Camellia", "airdate" => "7 May 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja learn that Naruto is inside the Three-Tailed beast. With no other alternative but to trust Yuukimaru's mystical senses, Kakashi and the others follow the boy's guidance and attempt a rescue mission...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229538.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e19", "season" => 2009, "number" => 19, "name" => "Cursed Seal Counterattack", "airdate" => "14 May 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "With the Three-Tailed Beast readily approaching, the Barrier Sealing team is point to make sure it doesn't surface. However, Kabuto - unwilling to fail Orochimaru - is out to recapture Yuukimaru at whatever the cost...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229541.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e20", "season" => 2009, "number" => 20, "name" => "Memory of Guilt", "airdate" => "21 May 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Kabuto plots to have Three Tails crush the Leaf ninja by sacrificing Yuukimaru's power and life. Controlled by Yuukimaru, Three Tails' awesome power is about to break free from the seal, when an unexpected ally saves Shizune's sealing team.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229568.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e21", "season" => 2009, "number" => 21, "name" => "Shattered Promise", "airdate" => "28 May 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Kabuto finally appears before Naruto. Learning that Orochimaru used Guren's and Yuukimaru's feelings for his own purposes, an enraged Naruto enters battle against Kabuto.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229614.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e22", "season" => 2009, "number" => 22, "name" => "A Place to Return To", "airdate" => "4 Jun 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja fall back and tend to their wounds. The battle has left everyone with serious injuries. Shizune examines Yuukimaru, who is in a coma, but his body is no longer able to control Three Tails.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/491/1229679.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e23", "season" => 2009, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Serpent's Pupil", "airdate" => "11 Jun 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Orochimaru agonizes in pain at his hideout, now requiring level-ten medications just to sustain his body. Even with excruciating pain Orochimaru is preparing for his transference ritual, and Kabuto can feel Orochimaru's further potential. Meanwhile Sasuke als…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230250.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e24", "season" => 2009, "number" => 24, "name" => "Eye of a Hawk", "airdate" => "18 Jun 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Orochimaru sheds his old body and transforms into a white serpent. As he attacks Sasuke to obtain his body, Orochimaru remembers the time he found the cast off skin of a white snake in front of his parents' grave. Driven by his desire for the Sharingan, Oroch…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230257.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e25", "season" => 2009, "number" => 25, "name" => "Zabuza's Blade", "airdate" => "25 Jun 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Sasuke has defeated Orochimaru. He then frees Suigetsu, a man trapped inside a water tank, and tells the man to join him. But Suigetsu does not immediately take up Sasuke's offer…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230326.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e26", "season" => 2009, "number" => 26, "name" => "Guardian of the Iron Wall", "airdate" => "2 Jul 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Sasuke and Suigetsu visit the southern hideout to recruit their next member, Karin. Suigetsu is surprised at the hideout's low security level but is told that no prisoners can escape thanks to Karin's abilities. What is Karin's power that allows her to mainta…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230848.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e27", "season" => 2009, "number" => 27, "name" => "Juugo of the Northern Hideout", "airdate" => "9 Jul 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Sasuke and his team head for the northern hideout to recruit their next member, Jugo. On the way, Karin explains that the northern hideout is a site for conducting horrific human experiments. A ninja with abnormal homicidal impulses, Jugo is the sole carrier…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230871.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e28", "season" => 2009, "number" => 28, "name" => "Formation!", "airdate" => "23 Jul 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Slipping past the riot, Sasuke arrives at Jugo's cell. But Jugo refuses to be released, even going as far as to say he rather die a lonely death than to leave the hideout.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230884.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e29", "season" => 2009, "number" => 29, "name" => "Kakashi Chronicles: Boys' Life on the Battlefield Part 1", "airdate" => "30 Jul 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "\"More than ten years ago, the rule of the Five Great Shinobi Nations was destabilized, throwing the world into a conflict later to be known as the Third Great Ninja War. The future Fourth Hokage Minato Namikaze assigns young Kakashi, Obito of the Uchiha clan,…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230918.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e30", "season" => 2009, "number" => 30, "name" => "Kakashi Chronicles: Boys' Life on the Battlefield Part 2", "airdate" => "30 Jul 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.4, "summary" => "Obito ignores Kakashi's order to continue with the mission and leaves to save Rin, who was kidnapped by the Rock ninja. But the enemies detect Obito's arrival and defeat him. Kakashi arrives at the last minute and saves Obito…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1230928.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e31", "season" => 2009, "number" => 31, "name" => "Assemble", "airdate" => "6 Aug 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "After hunting down the Four Tails, Itachi and Kisame are summoned by the leader of the Akatsuki. The leader announces the death of Orochimaru to the gathered members and the possibility of his killer, Sasuke, setting his sights on the Akatsuki organization....", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1232149.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e32", "season" => 2009, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Hunt", "airdate" => "13 Aug 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Under Kakashi's command, the Leaf ninja set off to find Itachi. Using Kakashi's ninja hounds, they gather as much information as they can on Itachi. Meanwhile, the members of the Hebi also scatter to look for information on Itachi. Led by the ninja hound trac…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1232279.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e33", "season" => 2009, "number" => 33, "name" => "Clash!", "airdate" => "20 Aug 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Upon encountering one another, Sasuke and Deidara engage in battle. After exchanging a few blows to test Sasuke's strength, Deidara conjures up his specialty clay dragon and wages long-range attacks against Sasuke from high above. With Tobi's backup support,…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1232297.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e34", "season" => 2009, "number" => 34, "name" => "Art", "airdate" => "27 Aug 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Determined to destroy the Sharingan to rid himself of the taste of defeat he received from Itachi, Deidara unleashes his biggest attack, the C4 Karura. Created to kill Itachi, this fierce weapon is capable of destroying living beings from the inside using mil…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1232356.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e35", "season" => 2009, "number" => 35, "name" => "Disappearance", "airdate" => "3 Sep 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Sasuke goes missing after being caught by Deidara's suicidal bombing. Sensing his disappearance, Jugo, Karin, and Suigetsu race to Sasuke's last location, where the three Hebi members discover...?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/492/1232362.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e36", "season" => 2009, "number" => 36, "name" => "Twilight", "airdate" => "10 Sep 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Leaf ninja, she notifies the others and the Hebi members quickly leave the inn. To allow Sasuke to focus on his coming battle with Itachi, Karin comes up with a plan to keep the Leaf ninja occupied.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1232759.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e37", "season" => 2009, "number" => 37, "name" => "Tales of a Gutsy Ninja - Jiraiya Ninja Scroll (Part 1)", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "During the reign of the Second Hokage, the young Jiraiya, Orochimaru, and Tsunade are assigned to Hiruzen Sarutobi's platoon as Genins. Fascinated by Sarutobi's summoning jutsu, Jiraiya immerses himself in mastering the transportation technique. While trainin…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233074.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e38", "season" => 2009, "number" => 38, "name" => "Tales of a Gutsy Ninja - Jiraiya Ninja Scroll (Part 2)", "airdate" => "24 Sep 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Jiraiya's journey to seek out a student is postponed due to the outbreak of the Third Great Ninja War. Jiraiya joins Tsunade and Orochimaru to battle the Village Hidden in the Rain. Following the battle, the three ninja are named the \"Legendary Sannin,\" a tit…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233085.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e39", "season" => 2009, "number" => 39, "name" => "Infiltrate! The Village Hidden in the Rain", "airdate" => "8 Oct 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Jiraiya successfully infiltrates the Hidden Rain Village by hiding inside the toad Gamagoro. He sets out to gather information but finds no indications of a civil war occurring within the village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233111.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e40", "season" => 2009, "number" => 40, "name" => "The Man Who Became God", "airdate" => "8 Oct 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Foreseeing a possible battle, Jiraiya takes precautionary measures by releasing the scroll toad that commands the key to Naruto's Eight-Signed", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233122.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e41", "season" => 2009, "number" => 41, "name" => "Honoured Sage Mode!", "airdate" => "15 Oct 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Jiraiya battles to defeat his former student Pain, who is now driven by his twisted ideals as an Akatsuki member.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233131.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e42", "season" => 2009, "number" => 42, "name" => "In Attendance, the Six Paths of Pain", "airdate" => "22 Oct 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Jiraiya completes his Sage Mode transformation to battle the three Pains.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233149.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e43", "season" => 2009, "number" => 43, "name" => "The Tale of Jiraiya the Gallant", "airdate" => "29 Oct 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Having lost his arm, Jiraiya is outmatched by the six Pains now appearing before him. Of the six, the one called Tendo is revealed to be Jiraiya's former student Yahiko. Jiraiya is still puzzled by the Rinnegan's true powers, but before he can gather his thou…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233152.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e44", "season" => 2009, "number" => 44, "name" => "Banquet Invitation", "airdate" => "5 Nov 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Sasuke arrives at one of the Akatsuki hideouts, having followed in Itachi's footsteps. When Sasuke is about to enter the hideout alone, his older brother Itachi finally appears before him…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233236.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e45", "season" => 2009, "number" => 45, "name" => "The Longest Moment", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "While Itachi waits for Sasuke in the Uchiha hideout, he recalls the past incident that led to his defection from the Leaf Village. When Sasuke arrives, the fated battle begins between the two brothers.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233243.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e46", "season" => 2009, "number" => 46, "name" => "The Light and Dark of the Mangekyō Sharingan", "airdate" => "19 Nov 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Following their fierce genjutsu battle with the Sharingan, Itachi explains the secret behind the most powerful ocular jutsu, the Mangekyo Sharingan, and the history of the Uchiha clan…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233404.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e47", "season" => 2009, "number" => 47, "name" => "Amaterasu!", "airdate" => "26 Nov 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Sasuke loses his left eye to Itachi, but it turns out to be a genjutsu created by the Mangekyo Sharingan. Breaking free of the Tsukuyomi by force, Sasuke makes a furious comeback against the injured Itachi.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233410.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e48", "season" => 2009, "number" => 48, "name" => "The End", "airdate" => "3 Dec 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "At the climax of the battle, both Itachi and Sasuke run out of chakra. However, Sasuke reveals that his actions up until now were only a preparation for his final jutsu.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233415.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e49", "season" => 2009, "number" => 49, "name" => "The Mystery of Tobi", "airdate" => "10 Dec 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Naruto and his comrades find themselves held up by Tobi, whose strange jutsu is more than just a simple genjutsu.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233417.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e50", "season" => 2009, "number" => 50, "name" => "Fate", "airdate" => "17 Dec 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "In the Akatsuki hideout Sasuke comes face to face with Madara. Announcing himself as Itachi's accomplice from that fateful night, Madara goes on to tell Sasuke the truth about Itachi that he could never have known.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233428.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2009e51", "season" => 2009, "number" => 51, "name" => "Truth", "airdate" => "24 Dec 2009", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "The Uchiha clan was plotting a coup d'etat. The story as told by Madara leaves Sasuke at a loss for words. Because of his gifted talent, Itachi was forced to suffer, torn between his loyalties to the Leaf Village and the Uchiha clan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233740.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2010, "name" => "#362 - #412", "rating" => 8.8, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2010e1", "season" => 2010, "number" => 1, "name" => "Battle of Valley of Clouds and Lightning", "airdate" => "7 Jan 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Flame from the Amaterasu still remains on the battlefield as Naruto and his teammates continue to search for Sasuke. But despite the search team's best efforts, they cannot find any trace of him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1233752.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e2", "season" => 2010, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Eight-Tails vs. Sasuke", "airdate" => "14 Jan 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The Taka split up with the Akatsuki to hunt down the remaining Tailed Beast. At the Land of Lightning they go up against Killer Bee, whose attack utilizing Lightning Style and seven blades proves to be more than a match for them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1234293.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e3", "season" => 2010, "number" => 3, "name" => "Wanderer", "airdate" => "21 Jan 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja fail to capture Itachi and also lose track of Sasuke. Calling off their pursuit, the team is heading back to the village when an urgent assignment from Lady Tsunade comes in. The mission stems from a treaty between the Third Hokage and the En n…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/493/1234965.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e4", "season" => 2010, "number" => 4, "name" => "Successor of the Forbidden Jutsu", "airdate" => "28 Jan 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto and his teammates are assigned to escort Hotaru, En no Gyoja's granddaughter, to the Tsuchigumo Clan's village located in the mountains. But Hotaru's mind is still attached to Utakata, who left after Naruto's arrival…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1235623.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e5", "season" => 2010, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Successor's Wish", "airdate" => "4 Feb 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Having arrived at the village, Hotaru parts with Naruto and his team. But the Magaki Troops are one step ahead and threaten Hotaru to hand over the forbidden jutsu. Utakata appears, and Shiranami recognizes him as a bounty listed in the Hidden Mist's bingo bo…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1235945.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e6", "season" => 2010, "number" => 6, "name" => "Rogue Ninja's Past", "airdate" => "11 Feb 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Yamato and Sai recognize their opponents as trackers from the Hidden Mist Village, but Naruto attacks without questioning. The Hidden Mist demands Utakata be handed over to them in exchange for Hotaru.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1235962.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e7", "season" => 2010, "number" => 7, "name" => "Heir to Darkness", "airdate" => "18 Feb 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Hotaru is brought back to the fort in Mount Katsuragi. Naruto, outraged to learn the forbidden jutsu was embedded inside Hotaru, demands an explanation from Tonbei. But it was none other than Hotaru herself who wished for this.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1235980.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e8", "season" => 2010, "number" => 8, "name" => "Separation", "airdate" => "25 Feb 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Believing Shiranami's story, Hotaru writes a parting letter addressed to Utakata and leaves Mount Katsuragi. Meanwhile Naruto, still searching for Shiranami, falls into the Magaki Troops' trap but manages to escape thanks to help from Utakata.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1235984.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e9", "season" => 2010, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Forbidden Jutsu Released", "airdate" => "4 Mar 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Naruto and Utakata successfully enter the Tsuchigumo village thanks to help from Sakura, Sai, and Yamato. Utakata senses the chakra filling the atmosphere and terrain behaving oddly, and together with Naruto, they enter the cave where the anomaly is originati…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236154.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e10", "season" => 2010, "number" => 10, "name" => "Master and Student", "airdate" => "11 Mar 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Hotaru, under the control of Shiranami's jutsu, uses the Forbidden Jutsu against Naruto and Utakata. Shiranami trembles with joy, having witnessed the power of the Forbidden Jutsu, while Hotaru is consumed by deep despair.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236158.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e11", "season" => 2010, "number" => 11, "name" => "Sombre News", "airdate" => "25 Mar 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Returning from the mission, Naruto recollects his strange encounter with Itachi. What did the now deceased Itachi wish to tell him? As Naruto ponders this, Kakashi makes an abrupt visit.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236167.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e12", "season" => 2010, "number" => 12, "name" => "Following the Master's Shadow", "airdate" => "25 Mar 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto wanders the streets of the Leaf Village, grief stricken over the death of Jiraiya. Unable to overcome his feeling of loss, Naruto traces back through his memories of Jiraiya. What can help the heartbroken Naruto get back on his feet?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236183.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e13", "season" => 2010, "number" => 13, "name" => "Decryption", "airdate" => "8 Apr 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Naruto and his friends successfully decipher the code Jiraiya left behind with the help of some information Naruto has. The crew immediately calls Fukasaku over, but the message is not enough to solve the mystery of Pain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236235.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e14", "season" => 2010, "number" => 14, "name" => "The First Challenge", "airdate" => "8 Apr 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "At Mount Myoboku, Naruto begins his Sage Jutsu training under Fukasaku. The first challenge is \"Don't move.\" Fukasaku explains that an extensive amount of time is necessary in order to take in nature energy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236304.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e15", "season" => 2010, "number" => 15, "name" => "Surpassing the Master", "airdate" => "15 Apr 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto continues his Sage training at Mount Myoboku, but with very slow progress. Fukasaku runs out of patience and suggests they move on to the next training…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236270.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e16", "season" => 2010, "number" => 16, "name" => "Assault on the Leaf Village!", "airdate" => "22 Apr 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Shikamaru and the others wait for the information Jiraiya brought back to be analyzed. The Hidden Leaf ninja continue their data analysis, when disaster strikes the village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236277.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e17", "season" => 2010, "number" => 17, "name" => "Power to Believe", "airdate" => "29 Apr 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The Leaf Village is under heavy attack from Pain and Konan. Hearing the Akatsuki attack, Tsunade attempts to contact Fukasaku…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236285.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e18", "season" => 2010, "number" => 18, "name" => "Pain vs. Kakashi", "airdate" => "6 May 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "In one area of the village, Kakashi enters battle against Tendo Pain, but he can't keep up with Tendo's mysterious attacks. Shurado joins the fight, and Kakashi struggles with the two-on-one disadvantage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236290.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e19", "season" => 2010, "number" => 19, "name" => "Mystery of Pain", "airdate" => "13 May 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The Leaf Village is under heavy attack from the Akatsuki. Underneath the village Danzo takes action to achieve his ambition. Meanwhile, searching through the Rain ninja's mind, Inoichi Yamanaka is about to stumble upon valuable information.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236291.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e20", "season" => 2010, "number" => 20, "name" => "Surname is Sarutobi. Given Name, Konohamaru!", "airdate" => "20 May 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Konohamaru, Moegi, and Udon are shocked to see the disaster that has struck their home village. But to fulfill their duties as genin, each races out to direct the villagers to a safe location.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236297.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e21", "season" => 2010, "number" => 21, "name" => "Pain to the World", "airdate" => "27 May 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Tsunade comes face to face with Tendo Pain on the rooftop of the Hokage mansion. When Pain demands the Nine Tails be handed over, Tsunade refuses. However, Pain uses the Ningendo's power to learn of Naruto's current location in Mount Myoboku. Tsunade clenches…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236322.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e22", "season" => 2010, "number" => 22, "name" => "Explode! Sage Mode", "airdate" => "3 Jun 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Sensing danger at hand, Naruto, along with Fukasaku, rushes back to the Leaf Village from Mount Myoboku. But what they see is the remains of the Leaf Village, leveled beyond recognition.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236553.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e23", "season" => 2010, "number" => 23, "name" => "Danger! Sage Mode Limit Reached", "airdate" => "10 Jun 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.6, "summary" => "Naruto hits Pain with his Sage Jutsu-perfected Wind Style Rasen Shuriken. Although he succeeds in defeating Ningendo, the remaining Pain quickly confronts him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236559.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e24", "season" => 2010, "number" => 24, "name" => "Nine-Tails, Captured!", "airdate" => "17 Jun 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Gamabunta and the other toads are defeated while Naruto is captured by Pain. Naruto attempts to fight back with Sage Jutsu, but Gakido sucks out his chakra, forcing him to go out of Sage Mode.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236568.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e25", "season" => 2010, "number" => 25, "name" => "Confession", "airdate" => "24 Jun 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Fukasaku and Shima fall in battle, leaving Naruto open to be captured by Tendo Pain. Just when all is thought to be lost, Hinata, who was following the battle with her Byakugan, steps in to face Pain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236574.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e26", "season" => 2010, "number" => 26, "name" => "Chibaku Tensei", "airdate" => "1 Jul 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Naruto loses himself after seeing Hinata taken out right before his eyes. His anger triggers the Nine Tails' chakra to go out of control.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236578.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e27", "season" => 2010, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Fourth Hokage", "airdate" => "15 Jul 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Naruto meets Minato Namikaze, the Fourth Hokage, inside his inner world. Before his death, Minato planted a fail-safe where he would appear within Naruto's psyche should his son sprout eight tails.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236585.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e28", "season" => 2010, "number" => 28, "name" => "The Two Students", "airdate" => "22 Jul 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "To break the cycle of hate, Naruto heads to where the real Pain is hiding.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236589.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e29", "season" => 2010, "number" => 29, "name" => "Big Adventure! The Quest for the Fourth Hokage's Legacy Part 1", "airdate" => "29 Jul 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "The story goes back to right before the start of the final rounds of the Chunin Exam. As Naruto trains in preparation for his upcoming match, he hears Jiraiya speak of \"the Fourth Hokage's legacy.\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236598.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e30", "season" => 2010, "number" => 30, "name" => "Big Adventure! The Quest for the Fourth Hokage's Legacy Part 2", "airdate" => "29 Jul 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Naruto and the others take on the oncoming challenges in order to find the secret technique and break the previous record set by the Fourth Hokage. But Naruto's impulsive action leads the group into various troubles.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236604.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e31", "season" => 2010, "number" => 31, "name" => "Meeting", "airdate" => "5 Aug 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "Naruto comes face to face with Nagato and Konan. Naruto, wanting to confront the problem of their hate-filled ninja world, asks to hear Nagato's side of the story before coming up with an answer.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236633.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e32", "season" => 2010, "number" => 32, "name" => "Origin of Pain", "airdate" => "12 Aug 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "To fulfill their dream, Nagato, Yahiko, and Konan walk through the war zone in search of Jiraiya, hoping to learn ninjutsu from him. After completing their training, the three form an organization with Yahiko as its leader.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236643.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e33", "season" => 2010, "number" => 33, "name" => "Tale of Naruto Uzumaki", "airdate" => "19 Aug 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Naruto remains silent after learning of Nagato's painful past. Nagato claims true peace cannot exist in this cursed world, dismissing Jiraiya's ideal as nothing more than wishful thinking.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236648.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e34", "season" => 2010, "number" => 34, "name" => "Hero of the Hidden Leaf", "airdate" => "26 Aug 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Nagato, having decided to believe in Naruto's word, performs his last forbidden jutsu: Gedo Art Rinne Rebirth.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1236729.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e35", "season" => 2010, "number" => 35, "name" => "Rookie Instructor Iruka", "airdate" => "2 Sep 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "The Leaf Village is left in ruins in the wake of Pain's assault on the village. While cleaning through the remains of Ninja Academy, Iruka finds an old pillar and recognizes it as a memoir from Naruto's early years at the academy.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/494/1237098.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e36", "season" => 2010, "number" => 36, "name" => "Iruka's Ordeal", "airdate" => "9 Sep 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.2, "summary" => "Naruto spends his days competing with Sasuke, the academy's star student, only to screw up and be the laughingstock of the class. Due to the childhood trauma of losing his parents to the Nine-Tailed Fox, Iruka finds it difficult to interact with Naruto as his…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1237644.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e37", "season" => 2010, "number" => 37, "name" => "Iruka's Decision", "airdate" => "16 Sep 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Naruto takes up his classmates' dare to venture into the forest and retrieve an item from the dead enemy ninja, unaware that the forest is still dangerous.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1237658.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e38", "season" => 2010, "number" => 38, "name" => "Kakashi Hatake, the Jōnin in Charge", "airdate" => "30 Sep 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "An emergency council is held before the Feudal Lord of the Land of Fire. The topic is to discuss plans to rebuild the Leaf Village, and Danzo strongly urges the council to select a new Hokage to replace Tsunade.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1237692.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e39", "season" => 2010, "number" => 39, "name" => "Inari's Courage Put to the Test", "airdate" => "7 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "The Leaf ninja work to rebuild the Hidden Leaf Village. While helping with the restoration, Naruto and Sakura are reunited with two old friends—the carpenter Tazuna and his grandson Inari from the Land of Waves.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238165.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e40", "season" => 2010, "number" => 40, "name" => "Naruto's School of Revenge", "airdate" => "14 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Team 7 stops in a town for some rest, where they encounter a man named Tsukado who is out to avenge the death of his relative.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238181.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e41", "season" => 2010, "number" => 41, "name" => "Gaara's Bond", "airdate" => "21 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Gaara, recalling a past mission carried out with the Leaf's Team 7, points out that the Leaf Village has Naruto with them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238193.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e42", "season" => 2010, "number" => 42, "name" => "Naruto: Outbreak", "airdate" => "28 Oct 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Naruto visits Sakura, who is caring for Tsunade. Sakura recalls an incident that took place three years before, in which she collapsed from symptoms that resembled a disease caused by a mysterious virus.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238427.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e43", "season" => 2010, "number" => 43, "name" => "Deploy! Team Tenten", "airdate" => "4 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Tenten and Neji head for the Leaf Ninja Tool Research Lab to procure ninja tools necessary for rebuilding the Leaf Village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238431.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e44", "season" => 2010, "number" => 44, "name" => "Animal District", "airdate" => "11 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Condor, the ostrich previously captured by Team 7, now lives in a forest with baby ostriches. Since his last escape, Condor has trained himself to become a ninja ostrich.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238477.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e45", "season" => 2010, "number" => 45, "name" => "Ah, the Medicine of Youth", "airdate" => "18 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "After accidentally finishing off Lee's last special youth drink, Naruto asks Guy to make more, only to learn one of its key ingredients, the Jofuku Flower, is out of stock. Naruto is determined to get the Jofuku Flower for Lee's sake.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238480.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e46", "season" => 2010, "number" => 46, "name" => "Gutsy Master and Student: The Training", "airdate" => "25 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Jiraiya takes Naruto to a village in the hopes of teaching him how to counter the Sharingan's genjutsu attack.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238661.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e47", "season" => 2010, "number" => 47, "name" => "Record of the Gutsy Ninja Master and Student", "airdate" => "25 Nov 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Naruto and Jiraiya attempt to save a village from Kandachi, a former right-hand man to Hanzo of the Hidden Rain.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238884.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e48", "season" => 2010, "number" => 48, "name" => "Sasuke's Paw Encyclopedia", "airdate" => "2 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Granny Cat requests that Sasuke and Team 7 collect the last cat paw print necessary to complete the \"Paw Encyclopedia.\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238899.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e49", "season" => 2010, "number" => 49, "name" => "Naruto and the Old Soldier", "airdate" => "9 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Naruto is assigned to a team led by jonin Hayama to patrol the north border of the Leaf Village. One of his teammates is Kosuke, an old man who has been a genin for over fifty years, earning him the title \"Eternal Genin.\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1238931.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e50", "season" => 2010, "number" => 50, "name" => "Kakashi's Love Song", "airdate" => "16 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "A beautiful kunoichi spy named Hanare is captured for attempting to gather intel on the Hidden Leaf.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239466.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2010e51", "season" => 2010, "number" => 51, "name" => "Neji Chronicles", "airdate" => "23 Dec 2010", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "During the Chunin Exam, Neji rests in the medical room, having lost to Naruto. Just as Tenten comes in to check up on him, they see the Leaf Village attacked by Orochimaru and his men.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239471.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2011, "name" => "#413 - #462", "rating" => 8.1, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2011e1", "season" => 2011, "number" => 1, "name" => "The Man Who Died Twice", "airdate" => "6 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7, "summary" => "On his way home Naruto comes across a rock pasted with a peculiar talisman, which he tears off without thinking. That night, Naruto is surprised to find an amnesic ghost standing near his bed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239491.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e2", "season" => 2011, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Worst Three-Legged Race", "airdate" => "13 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Team 7 is after a group of thieves who have stolen the precious Golden Statue from the Feudal Lord's sister.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239669.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e3", "season" => 2011, "number" => 3, "name" => "Team 10's Teamwork", "airdate" => "20 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Team 7 and Team 10 are assigned to help a village that is troubled by bandits.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239689.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e4", "season" => 2011, "number" => 4, "name" => "Drive Towards Darkness", "airdate" => "27 Jan 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "Sasuke's jealousy of Naruto's tremendous growth in strength causes friction between the two. Tsunade decides to give them some time apart by assigning them separate missions.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/495/1239717.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e5", "season" => 2011, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Sixth Hokage Danzo", "airdate" => "10 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Team Samui of the Hidden Cloud arrive at the Leaf Village and are shocked to find it in ruins. Nonetheless, they carry out their orders to deliver the Raikage's official letter to the Hokage, when Danzo appears and announces that he is the new Hokage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240228.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e6", "season" => 2011, "number" => 6, "name" => "Five Kage Summit's Eve", "airdate" => "10 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Karui and Omoi of the Hidden Cloud press Naruto to give information regarding Sasuke. Naruto realizes they're motivated by wanting to save their captured master, but decides he cannot sell out his friend. Instead, Naruto offers himself as a punching bag for K…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240232.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e7", "season" => 2011, "number" => 7, "name" => "Enter the Five Kage!", "airdate" => "17 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Kage from each nation set out to attend the Five Kage Summit.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240395.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e8", "season" => 2011, "number" => 8, "name" => "Naruto's Plea", "airdate" => "24 Feb 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "To prevent the cycle of hatred bound to occur should Sasuke be killed, Naruto goes to the Raikage and begs him to forgive Sasuke, but the Raikage quickly dismisses the request.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240421.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e9", "season" => 2011, "number" => 9, "name" => "Painful Decision", "airdate" => "3 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Mifune calls for the formation of the Allied Shinobi Forces to counter the Akatsuki and proposes the Hokage to lead them. Meanwhile, Sai reveals Naruto's actions to Sakura.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240424.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e10", "season" => 2011, "number" => 10, "name" => "Racing Lightning", "airdate" => "10 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Madara, who has taken an interest in Naruto, makes a sudden appearance before Naruto and reveals the truth behind Itachi's actions. Meanwhile, the samurai learn of Sasuke and his team Taka's entry into the Land of Iron, and battle ensues between the two group…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240429.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e11", "season" => 2011, "number" => 11, "name" => "Sasuke's Ninja Way", "airdate" => "17 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "The truth behind Itachi's actions leaves Naruto, Kakashi, and Yamato in shock. Madara then goes on to reveal the eternal hate stemming from as far back as the rivalry between the two sons of the legendary Sage of the Sixth Paths and its relation to the Uchiha…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240639.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e12", "season" => 2011, "number" => 12, "name" => "Power of the Five Kage", "airdate" => "24 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Having blocked the combined attacks of Gaara, Temari, Kankuro, and Darui with his Susano'o, Sasuke goes after Danzo.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240641.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e13", "season" => 2011, "number" => 13, "name" => "Declaration of War", "airdate" => "31 Mar 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.1, "summary" => "The four Kage are startled by the sudden appearance of Madara Uchiha. Having sent Sasuke away to safety using the Transportation Technique, Madara unveils to the Kage his \"Project Tsuki no Me.\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240652.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e14", "season" => 2011, "number" => 14, "name" => "Sakura's Feelings", "airdate" => "7 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "The Kage respond to Madara's declaration of war by forming the Allied Shinobi Forces, with the Raikage as their leader.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240664.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e15", "season" => 2011, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Tailed Beast vs. The Tailless Tailed Beast", "airdate" => "14 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.2, "summary" => "Killer Bee engages in a deadly battle against Kisame, who has come to capture the Eight-Tails.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240668.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e16", "season" => 2011, "number" => 16, "name" => "As One's Friend", "airdate" => "21 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Naruto learns from Sai that Sakura intends to kill Sasuke with her own hands. The Sand arrives to brief the Leaf ninja about what happened at the Five Kage Summit.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240878.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e17", "season" => 2011, "number" => 17, "name" => "Danzo's Right Arm", "airdate" => "28 Apr 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "Kakashi decides to go after Sakura to stop her, while Yamato and Naruto are ordered to return to the Leaf Village. Meanwhile, Sasuke confronts Danzo after seeing the many Sharingan embedded in his enemy's right arm.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240883.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e18", "season" => 2011, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Forbidden Visual Jutsu", "airdate" => "5 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Danzo's uncanny jutsu prevents Sasuke from landing a clean hit on his enemy. As Karin attempts to analyze Danzo's jutsu, Madara recognizes it as Izanagi.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240886.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e19", "season" => 2011, "number" => 19, "name" => "Danzō Shimura", "airdate" => "12 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Danzo believes he's won the battle against Sasuke. Little does he realize, Sasuke placed him under genjutsu before they last exchanged blows.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240891.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e20", "season" => 2011, "number" => 20, "name" => "Sakura's Resolve", "airdate" => "19 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Having tracked down Sasuke's whereabouts with Kiba's nose, Sakura attempts to put her allies to sleep and carry out the task of killing Sasuke herself.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240894.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e21", "season" => 2011, "number" => 21, "name" => "Lost Bonds", "airdate" => "26 May 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.6, "summary" => "Memories from his childhood course through Naruto's mind as he rests to recover from his hyperventilation.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1240897.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e22", "season" => 2011, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Burden", "airdate" => "2 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Sakura tells Sasuke that she wishes to desert the village and join him. A skeptical Sasuke tells Sakura he will believe her if she can finish off Karin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241030.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e23", "season" => 2011, "number" => 23, "name" => "Two Fates", "airdate" => "9 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Naruto reproaches Sasuke for attempting to kill Sakura. Then Sasuke reveals that he killed Danzo with his own hands. He goes on to declare his intent to purify the Uchiha clan's name by annihilating the Hidden Leaf.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e24", "season" => 2011, "number" => 24, "name" => "High-Level Shinobi", "airdate" => "16 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Years ago at the Final Valley, Sasuke told Naruto about high-level shinobi being able to understand one another just by trading blows. Having become a high-level shinobi, Naruto is now able to understand Sasuke's heart.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241042.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e25", "season" => 2011, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Infiltrator", "airdate" => "23 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "Killer Bee returns to the Hidden Cloud Village to the delight of Omoi and Karui. He has brought Kisame's sword, Samehada, with him. Bee believes the sword has taken a liking to him but is unaware that this is all just part of the Akatsuki's plan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e26", "season" => 2011, "number" => 26, "name" => "The Five Great Nations Mobilize", "airdate" => "30 Jun 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "The formation of the Allied Shinobi Forces is ratified by the Feudal Lords of the Five Great Nations. Each Kage returns to their village to prepare for the coming war", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241058.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e27", "season" => 2011, "number" => 27, "name" => "Kakashi Hatake, the Hokage", "airdate" => "7 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Naruto gathers his friends and tells them that he will defeat Sasuke alone. Meanwhile, the Elders of the Leaf officially nominate Kakashi to become the next Hokage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241068.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e28", "season" => 2011, "number" => 28, "name" => "Prophecy of the Great Lord Elder", "airdate" => "21 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.4, "summary" => "In Mount Myoboku, Gerotora, Fukasaku, and the Great Lord Elder are debating whether to give Naruto the key to the Tetragram Seal left behind by Jiraiya, an act that could unleash the Nine Tails.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241073.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e29", "season" => 2011, "number" => 29, "name" => "Storage", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "At Mount Myoboku, Naruto prepares to store Gerotora within himself, but hesitates as it also holds the potential risk of unleashing the Nine Tails on the world.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241085.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e30", "season" => 2011, "number" => 30, "name" => "The Five Kage's Decision", "airdate" => "28 Jul 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.9, "summary" => "The denizens of the Leaf Village ready themselves for the coming of the Fourth Great Ninja War.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241089.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e31", "season" => 2011, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Young Man and the Sea", "airdate" => "4 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Tsunade sends out Naruto under the guise of a top-secret mission to keep him hidden away from the Akatsuki. Unfortunately, Naruto, Yamato, Gai, and Aoba are stuck at the pier due to a report of a monster attacking ships.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241238.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e32", "season" => 2011, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Ninja of Benisu", "airdate" => "11 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.8, "summary" => "During their voyage, Naruto, Yamato, Gai, and Aoba stop at an island to recover from severe seasickness. There, they unexpectedly meet up with Sakura, Ino, and Choji, who are on an assignment to gather medical herbs for Tsunade.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241601.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e33", "season" => 2011, "number" => 33, "name" => "The Cursed Ghost Ship", "airdate" => "18 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Naruto's ship is stranded at sea due to heavy fog, when another ship suddenly appears.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241608.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e34", "season" => 2011, "number" => 34, "name" => "Battleship Island", "airdate" => "25 Aug 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.1, "summary" => "Pirates living on an island resembling a battleship open fire on Naruto's ship.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/496/1241660.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e35", "season" => 2011, "number" => 35, "name" => "The Forgotten Island", "airdate" => "2 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Going after Guy, who was whisked away by a giant bird, Naruto, Yamato, and Aoba arrive on an island where they spot a young woman.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243085.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e36", "season" => 2011, "number" => 36, "name" => "Fight! Rock Lee!", "airdate" => "9 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Guy recalls the time when he and Lee celebrated Lee learning the Hidden Lotus technique.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243088.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e37", "season" => 2011, "number" => 37, "name" => "Eat or Die! Mushrooms from Hell", "airdate" => "22 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Making a stop at a nearby port to stock up on supplies, Naruto buys a rare mushroom from a vegetable merchant. But soon after they set sail for their next destination, Naruto and the other crewmembers find their ship infested with poisonous mushrooms.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243434.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e38", "season" => 2011, "number" => 38, "name" => "Revenge of the Shadow Clones", "airdate" => "29 Sep 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Naruto's Shadow Clones turn against their master after feeling mistreated and overworked.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243445.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e39", "season" => 2011, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Closed Route", "airdate" => "6 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "As he prepares for the coming war, Shikamaru begins to feel the pressure of shouldering the lives of his friends. To help ease his mind, Shikaku sends his son on a mission to Mokuzu Island where Shikamaru meets up with Naruto.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243450.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e40", "season" => 2011, "number" => 40, "name" => "The Girls' Get-Together", "airdate" => "13 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Hinata's father Hiashi summons the Hyuga clan to discuss the role they will be playing in the upcoming Fourth Great Ninja War.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243882.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e41", "season" => 2011, "number" => 41, "name" => "Naruto's Imposter", "airdate" => "20 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "Naruto and the others encounter a thief who claims that he is Naruto Uzumaki of the Hidden Leaf. The real Naruto easily takes care of the imposter and hands him over to a ninja who was after the thief.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243884.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e42", "season" => 2011, "number" => 42, "name" => "Naruto's Favourite Pupil", "airdate" => "27 Oct 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "Konohamaru is eager to fight alongside his senior ninja in the coming war, but his young age prevents him from being assigned to the battlefield.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243886.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e43", "season" => 2011, "number" => 43, "name" => "The Kunoichi of Nadeshiko Village", "airdate" => "3 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Naruto meets two kunoichi ninja named Shizuka and Tokiwa from the Nadeshiko village who are seeking the student of Jiraiya.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243905.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e44", "season" => 2011, "number" => 44, "name" => "Friends You Can Count On", "airdate" => "10 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7, "summary" => "At the Ninja Academy, Shino recounts the time when he failed to capture a wanted thief.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1243989.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e45", "season" => 2011, "number" => 45, "name" => "Ah, My Hero Lady Tsunade!", "airdate" => "24 Nov 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "Tenten is helping out Lee's training to enhance his Eight Inner Gates.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244004.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e46", "season" => 2011, "number" => 46, "name" => "Sai's Day Off", "airdate" => "1 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.9, "summary" => "While taking a walk through the Leaf Village, Sai comes across some kids who remind him of Sakura and Naruto.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244257.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e47", "season" => 2011, "number" => 47, "name" => "The Legendary Ino–Shika–Chō", "airdate" => "8 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Ino, Choji, and Shikamaru run into Kosuke, an elderly genin who they saved in a previous mission.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244263.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e48", "season" => 2011, "number" => 48, "name" => "Kiba's Determination", "airdate" => "15 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.4, "summary" => "Kiba trains hard to catch up to Naruto, who is now hailed as the hero of the Leaf Village, but with little success. Feeling desperate, Kiba asks Kakashi if he could train him.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244376.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e49", "season" => 2011, "number" => 49, "name" => "Kakashi, My Eternal Rival!", "airdate" => "22 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "As the Leaf ninja's ship heads toward their final stop for supplies before entering the Land of Lightning, Yamato warns the crew to stay alert for enemies who could mimic both the appearance and chakra of their closest allies.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244420.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2011e50", "season" => 2011, "number" => 50, "name" => "Naruto's Vow", "airdate" => "28 Dec 2011", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "During his final stop for supplies on an island in the Land of Water, Naruto runs into Akatsuchi and Kurotsuchi of the Hidden Stone, who are on an assignment to deliver a letter from the Tsuchikage addressed to the Mizukage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244501.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2012, "name" => "#463 - #514", "rating" => 8.3, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2012e1", "season" => 2012, "number" => 1, "name" => "Land Ahoy! Is this the Island of Paradise?", "airdate" => "5 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "After a long voyage at sea, Naruto's ship finally arrives at the island of its destination. Before everyone can rejoice, a giant squid attacks the ship. Fortunately, the crew is saved by Killer Bee, the Eight Tails' jinchuriki host.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244528.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e2", "season" => 2012, "number" => 2, "name" => "Killer B and Motoi", "airdate" => "12 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.1, "summary" => "Motoi warns Naruto that he is not yet ready to enter training to control the Tailed Beast. Undaunted, Naruto asks Motoi to tell him more about Killer Bee.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244536.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e3", "season" => 2012, "number" => 3, "name" => "The Next Challenge! Naruto vs. The Nine-Tails!!", "airdate" => "19 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "With Killer Bee as his new master, Naruto begins his training to control the power of a Tailed Beast. In order to do so, one must fight the Tailed Beast head on and absorb its chakra, converting it into one's own power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244544.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e4", "season" => 2012, "number" => 4, "name" => "The Orange Spark", "airdate" => "26 Jan 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Inside his mind, Naruto continues his battle against Nine Tails to take control of its immense power.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244713.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e5", "season" => 2012, "number" => 5, "name" => "Target: Nine Tails", "airdate" => "2 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Sixteen years ago, Fourth Hokage Minato Namikaze and his wife Kushina are expecting their first child, much to the delight of the young couple.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244720.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e6", "season" => 2012, "number" => 6, "name" => "The Fourth Hokage's Death Match!", "airdate" => "9 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Minato is forced to use his Flying Raijin jutsu and leave his wife Kushina behind to save their newborn son, Naruto, from a masked assailant.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244727.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2012e7", "season" => 2012, "number" => 7, "name" => "Thank You", "airdate" => "9 Feb 2012", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Minato uses his Transportation Technique to move Nine Tails away from the Hidden Leaf Village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/497/1244752.jpg"),
