        array("id" => "s2014e37", "season" => 2014, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Day Naruto Was Born", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Minato is filled with regret during his confrontation with Obito. He thinks if only he had recognized Obito as the Masked Man during the assault on the Hidden Leaf Village, he could have stopped the attack, and maybe Kushina would not have died. The next day…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271288.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e38", "season" => 2014, "number" => 38, "name" => " Divine Tree", "airdate" => "9 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Naruto and Minato combine their powers to perform a Sage Jutsu attack on Obito.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271303.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e39", "season" => 2014, "number" => 39, "name" => "A Shinobi's Dream", "airdate" => "16 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The Ten Tails morphs into its final form, \"The Divine Tree,\" and attacks the shinobi, absorbing their chakra one after another.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271554.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e40", "season" => 2014, "number" => 40, "name" => "Pursuing Hope", "airdate" => "23 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Naruto's past, thoughts, and feelings flow into the consciousness of every shinobi, unifying their hearts.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271560.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e41", "season" => 2014, "number" => 41, "name" => "A Heart Filled With Comrades", "airdate" => "30 Oct 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Naruto and Sasuke size up Obito as the final battle looms. Working in sync, Naruto and Sasuke prepare to attack in the same way Madara once did, bedecking Kurama in the robes of Susano'o.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271566.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e42", "season" => 2014, "number" => 42, "name" => "Obito Uchiha", "airdate" => "6 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto objects to Obito's claim that he is the second Sage of Six Paths and declares that he is Obito Uchiha.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/508/1271567.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e43", "season" => 2014, "number" => 43, "name" => "I'm Always Watching", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Pressed by Naruto, Obito remembers the time he, Kakashi, and Rin teamed up for the Chunin Exam and when he promised Rin that he would become Hokage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1272596.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e44", "season" => 2014, "number" => 44, "name" => "The Promise That Was Kept", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Naruto's power of persuasion moves Obito's heart. Due to the influence of the Ten Tails, visions of himself and Rin from the past appear in the inner realm and play havoc with Obito's emotions.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1272598.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e45", "season" => 2014, "number" => 45, "name" => "My First Friend", "airdate" => "27 Nov 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "All the Tailed Beasts are freed, and old friends Kakashi and Obito come face to face with each other. What will Obito's response be? Meanwhile, the Tailed Beasts and the Allied Shinobi Forces shift their focus onto their greatest foe, Madara Uchiha. Gaara is…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1272602.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e46", "season" => 2014, "number" => 46, "name" => "The Adored Elder Sister", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Hanabi adores her sister Hinata, who struggles to become a worthy successor to the Hyuga Clan.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1272945.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e47", "season" => 2014, "number" => 47, "name" => "Hanabi's Decision", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "When Hinata is labeled unfit as a successor, Hanabi's heart becomes bound to her destiny.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1272948.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e48", "season" => 2014, "number" => 48, "name" => "Madara Uchiha Arises", "airdate" => "11 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Naruto and the Allied Shinobi Forces successfully extract the Tailed Beasts from Obito. Only Madara remains, and Naruto heads out to tackle this foe.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/60/150630.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e49", "season" => 2014, "number" => 49, "name" => "One's True Heart", "airdate" => "18 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "With his newly revived strength, Madara doesn't give in against the nine Tailed Beasts.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/359/897741.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2014e50", "season" => 2014, "number" => 50, "name" => "A True Ending", "airdate" => "25 Dec 2014", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Despite all efforts, Kurama is extracted from Naruto, and ultimately, all the Tailed Beasts are imprisoned inside the Gedo Statue.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/359/897746.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2015, "name" => "#614 - #663", "rating" => 7.7, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s2015e1", "season" => 2015, "number" => 1, "name" => "The New Chūnin Exams", "airdate" => "8 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The story travels back to the time after Sasuke's defection from the Leaf and before Naruto's return from his two-year training journey with Jiraiya.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273620.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e2", "season" => 2015, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Chūnin Exams Begin", "airdate" => "15 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Hidden Leaf begin preparing for the Chunin Exams. Ino and Choji ask Sakura to join their three-man team as a stand-in for Shikamaru, who is already a chunin.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273638.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e3", "season" => 2015, "number" => 3, "name" => "The Three Questions", "airdate" => "22 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Chunin Exams finally begin and the proctor for Round One is none other than Shikamaru! The first exam is a written test.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1273962.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e4", "season" => 2015, "number" => 4, "name" => "One Worthy as a Leader", "airdate" => "29 Jan 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The genin are unable to figure out the answer and start to panic. Neji announces to everyone in the room that he will tell them how to answer the question.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274795.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e5", "season" => 2015, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Night Before the Second Exam", "airdate" => "5 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "On the night before the Second Exam, the entrants gather in the cafeteria, and a brawl breaks out. While the Hidden Leaf stand by helpless, the only one who can calm everyone down is Fuu from the Hidden Waterfall Village.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274946.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e6", "season" => 2015, "number" => 6, "name" => "Demon Desert Survival", "airdate" => "12 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Second Exam finally begins! To pass this stage, each team must take possession of both the Heaven and Earth scrolls and make it to the designated site in the center of the Demon Desert within 72 hours.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274950.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e7", "season" => 2015, "number" => 7, "name" => "As a Taijutsu User", "airdate" => "19 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Noting the similarities of their circumstances, Lee is outraged at the ones who hurt and belittled Shira and sets out in pursuit!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274961.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e8", "season" => 2015, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Ultimate", "airdate" => "26 Feb 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Lee challenges Shira to a battle between taijutsu users!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274965.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e9", "season" => 2015, "number" => 9, "name" => "Escape vs. Pursuit", "airdate" => "5 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Kiba and his team are in pursuit of Hidden Grass Ninja who have stolen their scroll!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/509/1274970.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e10", "season" => 2015, "number" => 10, "name" => "Unwavering Gutsiness", "airdate" => "12 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Kiba and his team are in pursuit of Hidden Grass Ninja who have stolen their scroll!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/510/1275678.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e11", "season" => 2015, "number" => 11, "name" => "Tenten's Troubles", "airdate" => "19 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "As the team prepares for dinner, Tenten pulls out a scroll that contains all the ingredients for okonomiyaki.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/510/1276904.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e12", "season" => 2015, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Imprisoned Pair", "airdate" => "26 Mar 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "An ancient ruin in Demon Desert comes crumbling down during the battle for the scrolls.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/60/151009.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e13", "season" => 2015, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Place Where I Belong", "airdate" => "2 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Ino, Sakura and Choji trudge across a desert under the blazing sun without any provisions. Ino and Sakura are arguing when a giant scorpion attacks and injures Sakura.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/511/1278885.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e14", "season" => 2015, "number" => 14, "name" => "The Yamanaka Clan: Secret Ninjutsu", "airdate" => "9 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "As Ino and her team head toward an oasis, they are attacked by a team of Sand Shinobi comprised of Ameno, Shishio, and Kouji.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/511/1279434.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e15", "season" => 2015, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Cursed Puppet", "airdate" => "16 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 5.3, "summary" => "Sakura and her team continue their trek across the desert towards the goal. Their continuous battles have depleted Sakura's chakra, so they stop to rest. Just then, they encounter a puppet manipulated by a rival team from the Sand and end up being discovered.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/511/1279453.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e16", "season" => 2015, "number" => 16, "name" => "Their Backs", "airdate" => "23 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 5.7, "summary" => "Ino and Choji fight to protect an immobilized Sakura although they have depleted most of their chakra due to the relentless fighting.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280239.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e17", "season" => 2015, "number" => 17, "name" => "The Hidden Plot Set Into Motion", "airdate" => "30 Apr 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Sand Jonin Fugi sneaks into the Demon Desert and creates a massive sandstorm in order to assassinate Gaara, the Fifth Kazekage.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280350.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e18", "season" => 2015, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Targeted Tailed Beast", "airdate" => "7 May 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Gaara heads out to rescue Matsuri and the others but is attacked by a mysterious priest who binds him with a Chakra Chain to capture his Tailed Beast.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280439.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e19", "season" => 2015, "number" => 19, "name" => "Neji's Judgment", "airdate" => "14 May 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Neji and the team come across Matsuri collapsed in the desert and find out that Gaara is in danger. Meanwhile, the chains of a mysterious priest bind Gaara and Foo.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280441.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e20", "season" => 2015, "number" => 20, "name" => "Hopes Entrusted to the Future", "airdate" => "21 May 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Gaara meets with Fugi, the mastermind behind the assassination attempt on his life. He confides that perhaps, after all the fear and pain he has wrought upon the Sand, he has no right to be their leader.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280451.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e21", "season" => 2015, "number" => 21, "name" => "On the Brink of Death", "airdate" => "28 May 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "After his Tailed Beast is extracted, Naruto is on the verge of dying. Sakura desperately tries to save him, but Naruto's heart gives out.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280454.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e22", "season" => 2015, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Two Mangekyō", "airdate" => "4 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Madara has transformed into the Jinchuriki of the Ten Tails and appears before Kakashi. Kakashi and the others combine their powers to attack, but they are no match for Madara..", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280530.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e23", "season" => 2015, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Formation of Team Minato", "airdate" => "11 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Kakashi has changed for the worse, and Obito doesn't know why. He runs into Kakashi and tries to talk to him, but Kakashi gives him the cold shoulder.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280918.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e24", "season" => 2015, "number" => 24, "name" => "You'll Be My Backup", "airdate" => "25 Jun 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Obito doesn't understand Kakashi's way of thinking, but he finally learns why Kakashi put his mission first that time at Kannabi Bridge. Presently, Obito and Kakashi return together to confront Madara.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1280931.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e25", "season" => 2015, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Blue Beast vs. Six Paths Madara", "airdate" => "2 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.6, "summary" => "Guy releases his Eight Inner Gates against Madara, but the Seventh Gate of Shock does not work against him!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1281277.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2015e26", "season" => 2015, "number" => 26, "name" => "Papa's Youth", "airdate" => "9 Jul 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Dai counsels his forlorn son, telling him what true victory and setting self-rules are about. They become principles that Guy carves deep into his heart. With his father's teachings spurring him on, Guy sets out on his final battle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/512/1281289.jpg"),
