        array("id" => "s2015e37", "season" => 2015, "number" => 37, "name" => "Killer B Rappūden: Part 2", "airdate" => "17 Sep 2015", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The Akatsuki summoned the Ten Tails, but the Princess of Rappu Castle sealed it away safely. Unfortunately, the seal will come undone on the next full moon. Now Killer Bee is determined to gather the power of all nine Jinchuriki before the next full moon and…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/513/1284086.jpg"),
